<title>USA: NeoPharm says trading at post-split price.</title>
<headline>NeoPharm says trading at post-split price.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>NeoPharm Inc said its stock split for stockholders of record on August 26 was completed and both common stock and warrants to buy common stock are trading at the post-split price beginning Monday.</p>
<p>NeoPharm is engaged in research and development of drugs for the diagnosis and treatment of various forms of cancer.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
